      "en": "He brought me to the banquet hall. His banner over me is love.",
      "ko": "그가 나를 인도하여 잔치집에 들어갔으니 그 사랑이 내 위에 기로구나",
      "source_text_hash": "a3b273ff314beeead87f1bed1be3d10c5668a70275c8a628312dbba7c1819932",
      "translation_text_hash": "66c67c9fe5dcc6163e625e2502af9c143251e75cabdbbb2471ceda5c6b0425ac",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
